  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">B4D Facilitator Health Swecare - B4D Facilitator Health</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">B4D N&#xe4;tverk H&#xe4;lsa Swecare</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Swecare Foundation har ans&#xf6;kt om medel f&#xf6;r att i tre utvalda          pilotl&#xe4;nder fr&#xe4;mja och facilitera samarbeten mellan svenska och       nationella akt&#xf6;rer inom h&#xe4;lso- och sjukv&#xe5;rdssektorn. Swecare kommer   att agera som facilitator, etablera kontakter i partnerl&#xe4;nderna f&#xf6;r   att st&#xf6;dja en h&#xe5;llbar utveckling inom h&#xe4;lso och sjukv&#xe5;rdssektorn.     Insatsen ska genomf&#xf6;ras sep 2011-aug 2014.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Swecare Foundation has applied for support for its programme &quot;How to  use health networks in the development cooperation&quot;. The aim is to    select three developing countries in order to promote relations       between Swedish and national actors in the health sector. This        contribution should support the overall goal which is that poor       people should access professional and modernly equipped health care.</narrative>
  </description>
